  "body": "Phase 3 implements the authorized 26 requirements (23 MVP, 3 Competition Ready): PIT labels and exposures, five-stage processing, research operators/composites, split/purge/walk-forward, HAC and multiplicity, immutable experiments/reproduction, reports, and shared service/CLI.\n\nAQRP_FIXED_REVIEW_SHA: 5a5e093c2e9b39abe1332e49d1df40d20f9fd33f\n\nPrimary implementation reviewer: **GPT Work**. Review this exact 40-character commit; do not substitute drifting HEAD. G1 PLAN PASS at 3861ef1637bc2b4c28725d7afc5f2e1f02242e80 and U-001/U-002 confirmations are user-provided plan authorization, not implementation approval.\n\n### Fixed review material\n- [Review instructions](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/5a5e093c2e9b39abe1332e49d1df40d20f9fd33f/docs/audits/phase-3/IMPLEMENTATION_REVIEW_PACKAGE.md)\n- [26-requirement implementation traceability](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/5a5e093c2e9b39abe1332e49d1df40d20f9fd33f/docs/audits/phase-3/IMPLEMENTATION_TRACEABILITY.md)\n- [Authorization and limits](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/5a5e093c2e9b39abe1332e49d1df40d20f9fd33f/docs/audits/phase-3/IMPLEMENTATION_AUTHORIZATION.json)\n- [Implementation boundaries and remaining conditions](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/5a5e093c2e9b39abe1332e49d1df40d20f9fd33f/docs/audits/phase-3/IMPLEMENTATION_NOTES.md)\n- [Source/environment identity](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/5a5e093c2e9b39abe1332e49d1df40d20f9fd33f/docs/audits/phase-3/IMPLEMENTATION_IDENTITY.json)\n- [Developer validation and original evidence index](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/5a5e093c2e9b39abe1332e49d1df40d20f9fd33f/docs/audits/phase-3/IMPLEMENTATION_VALIDATION.json)\n- [323-file archive manifest](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/5a5e093c2e9b39abe1332e49d1df40d20f9fd33f/docs/audits/phase-3/FILE_MANIFEST.json)\n- [Four-principal security review and correction](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/5a5e093c2e9b39abe1332e49d1df40d20f9fd33f/docs/audits/phase-3/implementation/ROLE_REVIEW_RESPONSE.md)\n\n### Developer execution evidence\nBusiness source commit: 07e7c88745c031feeaee5d1e374a02caada77777. Final review commit adds documentation/raw evidence and a narrow .gitleaks.toml exception for one verified historical public cache digest. src, tests, tools, workflow and dependencies are byte-identical to that business commit; the scanner configuration delta requires separate validation.\nSource bundle SHA-256: a1e52e1744d604976f1ebfdd4275bf02b4ff8a1927c73972f72cc4b284623ce4 (45 modules).\nrequirements.lock SHA-256: 86c7bf65c9a9690036006360062c8cd10a91279705b4070af7033d7699abffeb.\n\n- Clean installed SDK: CPython 3.13.16, **564 passed**, coverage gates passed. Immutable environment, wheel, outputs, logs and hashes archived.\n- Original supplementary regression scripts: **16 passed + 4 passed**, executed by Codex; original authorship does not mean GPT Work executed this run.\n- Business-commit Actions run [39679991203](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/actions/runs/39679991203): Windows and Ubuntu **564 passed each**, official raw ZIPs fully verified (SHA-256, byte size, CRC, selected file manifests, wheel modules, environment, tests, research outputs, original 0.2 reproduction).\n  - Windows artifact 12384560494: 95523344 bytes; SHA-256 4a7d53caf99cec9e048f2306113b67947eea63628e8eb92ea7bfc1bd9b2667d2.\n  - Ubuntu artifact 12383014611: 136795910 bytes; SHA-256 ebe7c4daecb7d50dd06e8d16adc2efc5f02849d9a83c62dd1c275cb641f68eaa.\n- Repository contains a declared 163-file SDK evidence selection; 22 dependency wheels are retained in the complete local SDK and official original ZIP, explicitly omitted from Git. The subset is not presented as the complete original ZIP.\n- Archive commit bc99dc671d7292a8cb9e77cea17d91e84193bc6d FAILED both CI jobs in run 39682778261 at secret scanning. This failure is retained and is not counted as passing. The finding is a recomputed public synthetic cache SHA-256; the final configuration limits the exception to generic-api-key, the exact historical file path AND that exact extracted digest. Full scanning and adversarial controls pass locally: exact cache allowed; same digest elsewhere detected; altered-line synthetic credential detected. [Failure evidence and correction](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/5a5e093c2e9b39abe1332e49d1df40d20f9fd33f/docs/audits/phase-3/implementation/archive-scan-correction/RESPONSE.md).\n- Final fixed-commit [Actions run 39683883359](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/actions/runs/39683883359): **Windows SUCCESS / Ubuntu SUCCESS; 564 passed, 0 failed, 0 errors, 0 skipped per OS**. Both official original ZIPs were downloaded and verified by the developer for SHA-256, size, CRC, exact upload selection, source/wheel identity, coverage gates, snapshots, ledgers, reports and old-version reproduction.\n  - [Ubuntu original ZIP artifact 12385084521](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/actions/runs/39683883359/artifacts/12385084521): 136795968 bytes; SHA-256 `79b0ad94ed0590b01db556af7a85c605253a94e6966cb29d7bfb295e575e3d09`; 184 selected files; wheel SHA-256 `2f0e0b9468966fbaac58234715e049db7a19b297a4c44b0a487877a2f4d2b6b9`.\n  - [Windows original ZIP artifact 12385054743](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/actions/runs/39683883359/artifacts/12385054743): 95523501 bytes; SHA-256 `9063a8f7bebfa3e441eaed9e1476da8536ca1244b05ed1a1f55891d0f7fbdea3`; 185 selected files; wheel SHA-256 `0538c54ffb9b5a7e0f090c32604ce4889104fd3e4977149b01d2f47b780b6c18`.\n  - Actions executed PR integration commit `ab885d4f48053bad52c77c6e10a4949aec9765c8`; its **entire Git tree** `bd0e3578f594008962b3809d88fdbe5193262642` was fetched and verified equal to fixed review commit `5a5e093c2e9b39abe1332e49d1df40d20f9fd33f`. This integration ref is not a main merge.\n  - Each raw archive contains actual `environment.json`, `commands.log`, `junit.xml`, coverage, immutable output manifests, wheel and `upload-selection.json`. The 45 wheel source modules match the fixed source bundle; 66 original published files and 3 old original runs were verified/replayed.\n  - Official artifacts expire on 2026-11-20; exact original ZIPs plus verification receipts are also retained locally under `C:\\Users\\11638\\AppData\\Local\\AQRP\\runs\\p3-implementation-20261022\\actions-original\\5a5e093-{ubuntu,windows}-original.zip` and corresponding `-verification.json`. The final local aggregate receipt is `C:\\Users\\11638\\AppData\\Local\\AQRP\\runs\\p3-implementation-20261022\\final-review-receipt.json`. Final-run receipts are registered here without inventing a self-referential Git commit.\n\n### Conditions remaining\nG2 fixed-SHA independent implementation review by GPT Work, actual four-principal deployment verification, real independent sealed Test execution, formal statistical protocol/proof acceptance, financial approval and human phase acceptance remain unverified/pending. Unit mocks, engineering synthetic outputs and hosted CI do not establish actual isolation or financial approval.\nU-001 confirms design only. **No account/ACL/service/scheduler configuration was changed; no real sealed Test deployment was performed.**\n\nNo merge, no tags, no Phase 4. main remains f26255fc40a3080bfa883ad64938f60036a14759; stable tags unchanged.",
